ur=200&s=f9278d884b537619029a949a45fbcf0c, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1981338373273858048%2Fmc_Z3qe1.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bc7dfb0ed868ec2d278194226288e55d 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1981338373273858048%2Fmc_Z3qe1.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f4adf4ce11409303da57139ad3c2dda 3x"}, "body": "またまたHAGISOPHさん、こんにちは！\n\nハープシコードを使った曲をお願いしたいです。\n私のキャラのコンセプトは悪役令嬢イセカイです！大好きなBL小説にイセカイされちゃいました。お嬢様にふさわしい曲をお願いします。\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZhnyTB8DVEH5p_sBGaKcUMjXMj0IuHJ2\n\n念のためキャラリファレンスもリンクしておきます\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TbgCZHIr5ifrBfe1CmOUbT9eekOWht-6\n\n配信用BGMとして使いたいです。あなたの速いビートの音楽アレンジは本当に楽しいですし、あなたの判断を信頼しています！ありがとうございました。\n\nHello again HAGISOPH-san! \n\nI would like to request music from you that features the harpsicord.\nThe concept of my character is Villainess Isekai! She got isekai-ed into her favorite BL novel. I would like music that is fitting for an oujou-sama. \n\nI will link a playlist of music I like that features the harpischord, and what I like in general:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZhnyTB8DVEH5p_sBGaKcUMjXMj0IuHJ2\n\nI will also link my character reference just in case:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TbgCZHIr5ifrBfe1CmOUbT9eekOWht-6\n\nI would like to use it as a BGM for streaming. I really enjoy your fast beat music arrangements and trust your judgement! Thank you.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZhnyTB8DVEH5p_sBGaKcUMjXMj0IuHJ2", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Hagisoph/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 130295, "client_id": 337113, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net